Package: tyvera
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10)
Recommends: g++
Description: experimental bootstrap toolchain for the Tyvera language
 Tyvera is an experimental statically typed programming language with its own
 syntax, type checker, runtime, and standard library. This package installs
 the Python bootstrap/reference toolchain; generated native programs do not
 require Python at runtime, while compiling them requires a C++17 compiler.
